  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "1989-09-21",
   "text": "Excessive Churning and Speculation Act of 1989 - Amends the Internal Revenue Code to impose an excise tax on the gain on the sale by employer pension plans of investment assets held 180 days or less. Exempts pension plans with assets of less than $1,000,000."
  }
